        "id": 2136119763,
        "content": "Plugin developers need to import the configuration to modify the output of their plugins. We should make this as simple as possible with an NPM module. This module should abstract away the following:\r\n1. fetching the repository configuration\r\n2. fetching the organization configuration\r\n3. merging to a single configuration\r\n4. config validation\r\nPseudo code (I didn't deeply think through this):\r\n```ts\r\nimport { getConfig } from \"@ubiquibot/configuration\";\r\nconst config = await getConfig(context);\r\n```\r\nOriginal post: https://github.com/ubiquity/pay.ubq.fi/issues/135#issuecomment-1945382710",
        "url": "https://github.com/ubiquity-os/configuration-loader/issues/1",
        "commentType": "ISSUE_SPECIFICATION",
